/// The first-party Copilot CLI client identity (gh-1606 PAT mode): the
/// official Copilot CLI presents `copilot-developer-cli` + a
/// `copilot/<version> (<os>) term/unknown` user-agent when it uses a
/// fine-grained PAT directly. fa reuses that shape so PAT mode is
